  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien indie pop in the bright guitar-light bedroom-band style. Strummed ukulele driving eighth notes; glockenspiel doubling the chorus melody; brushed snare and soft kick in a bouncing straight beat; a melodic electric bass walking up into each chorus; handclaps on the chorus. Sunny, dry, close production, glockenspiel sitting on top, no wall of guitars. A light female mid-range voice, chatty and smiling, with a second female voice answering the hook lines. 118 BPM, G major. Bright, clumsy and giggling. No autotune, no trap beat, no EDM drop, no power ballad, no distorted rock guitar.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n禮拜下晡 熱甲袂喘氣\n阿芳對阿嬸遐 借來一台剉冰機\n鐵仔做的 愛用手搖\n冰角囥入去 硞硞叫\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n搖三輾 就卡牢咧\n三个人 頭殼相倚咧看\n\n[Chorus]\n剉冰 剉冰 閣搖一下\n冰角 冰角 莫閣卡\n樣仔切甲 一塊一塊\n煉奶 淋甲 溢出來\n\n[Verse]\n阿美搖甲 手骨痠\n換我搖 冰角煞噴規廳\n貓仔 走去眠床跤覕\n阿芳 舐桌頂的煉奶\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n冰閣卡牢 我大力一下\n規台機器 倒落塗跤\n\n[Chorus]\n剉冰 剉冰 閣搖一下\n冰角 冰角 滾去椅仔跤\n撿起來洗洗 閣再剉\n三碗冰 剉甲欲一點鐘\n\n[Bridge]\n食著第一喙 冷甲頭殼疼\n阿美講 這是今年 上好食的\n我講 是因為 咱家己剉的\n\n[Chorus]\n剉冰 剉冰 閣搖一下\n冰角 冰角 莫閣卡\n借的機器 明仔載愛還\n阿嬸若問 就講 真好用\n\n[Outro]\n三支湯匙 一碗空空",
